{"4205860": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "World Without", "steam_appid": 4205860, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the World of Miladonia</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >World Without is an <strong>open-world Action-RPG</strong> where you explore the continent of Miladonia. Face <strong>numerous enemies</strong>, recruit <strong>new characters</strong>, <strong>assemble</strong> and <strong>arm</strong> your <strong>team</strong>, then take on the <strong>terrible bosses</strong> occupying the continent !</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Push the boundaries of action RPGs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was designed to redefine the rules of Action-RPGs: <strong>dodges</strong>, <strong>counters</strong>, <strong>spell combinations</strong> and <strong>dynamic team play</strong> are all part of the experience. The <strong>main quest</strong> takes centre stage with its share of <strong>cutscenes</strong>, <strong>scenarios</strong> and <strong>rewards</strong>. Find out what happened to our hero, Naoya !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To help you, you have many tools at your disposal: <strong>craft your equipment</strong>, <strong>adopt</strong> a <strong>horse</strong> or <strong>dragons</strong>, <strong>upgrade</strong> your <strong>characters</strong> and <strong>explore the world of Miladonia to earn fabulous rewards !</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game also offers many challenges for the most daring players: <strong>Challenge Tower</strong>, NG+, open-world bosses... There's something for everyone ! </p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the World of Miladonia</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >World Without is an <strong>open-world Action-RPG</strong> where you explore the continent of Miladonia. Face <strong>numerous enemies</strong>, recruit <strong>new characters</strong>, <strong>assemble</strong> and 